      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please account for the time resolution before formatting all date/time fields. \n\nCurrently, only the null resolution is handled. For a timestamp with year resolution, the remaining fields are not significant, but this code still prints them. For example, year 2026 with zeroed lower fields produces 2026-00-00T00:00:00.000000. Please display only the known precision or explicitly mark the unknown components.",
