      "writtenOn": "2026-11-04T04:08:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done in PS4. The output is truncated to the time resolution (year → 2026, month → 2026-08, day → 2026-08-20, hour → 2026-08-20T15, minute → 2026-08-20T15:30, second → …:45, 10 ms → …:45.12, and so on). A field known only to its tens digit keeps that digit followed by * (for example 15:3*), following the CIM DateTime convention the spec references for this byte. The UTC offset is rendered at its own resolution (+05, +05:3*, +05:30) and omitted when unspecified. Reserved resolution values are reported as malformed.",
      "parentUuid": "88966aec_1f89cf30",
      "revId": "ad448cbffe946c69120b5bc85c452b747a255973",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
